{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國地震台網測定，青海玉樹州雜多縣繼周五（23日）晚上發生4.5級地震後，周六（24日）上午8時07分再發生地震，強度為4.2級，震源深度10公里。</p><p>（央視新聞）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:44:53.294133+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T01:30:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:10:05.893722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:38:50.940630+00:00","content_hash":"755a3fefad2926b5cbaeee1a938532ff4254c349d38a00beb404bda1d06e0cd5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}